/p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.690" end="01:00.200"><span begin="00:56.690" end="00:57.050">Or </span><span begin="00:57.050" end="00:57.380">how </span><span begin="00:57.380" end="00:58.010">one </span><span begin="00:58.010" end="00:58.940">becomes </span><span begin="00:58.940" end="01:00.200">two</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.320" end="01:07.250"><span begin="01:03.320" end="01:03.710">I </span><span begin="01:03.710" end="01:04.130">just </span><span begin="01:04.130" end="01:04.460">can't </span><span begin="01:04.460" end="01:05.420">recall </span><span begin="01:05.420" end="01:05.690">what </span><span begin="01:05.690" end="01:06.290">started </span><span begin="01:06.290" end="01:06.350">it </span><span begin="01:06.350" end="01:07.250">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.520" end="01:10.790"><span begin="01:07.520" end="01:07.760">Or </span><span begin="01:07.760" end="01:08.060">how </span><span begin="01:08.060" end="01:08.180">to </span><span begin="01:08.180" end="01:08.870">begin </span><span begin="01:08.870" end="01:09.080">the </span><span begin="01:09.080" end="01:10.790">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.850" end="01:20.570"><span begin="01:13.850" end="01:14.300">I </span><span begin="01:14.300" end="01:14.630">ain't </span><span begin="01:14.630" end="01:14.900">here </span><span begin="01:14.900" end="01:15.140">to </span><span begin="01:15.140" end="01:15.710">break </span><span begin="01:15.710" end="01:16.310">it</span><span begin="01:16.310" end="01:16.460">, </span><span begin="01:16.460" end="01:16.820">just </span><span begin="01:16.820" end="01:17.240">see </span><span begin="01:17.240" end="01:17.480">how </span><span begin="01:17.480" end="01:18.290">far </span><span begin="01:18.290" end="01:18.500">it </span><span begin="01:18.500" end="01:19.130">will </span><span begin="01:19.130" end="01:20.570">bend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.950" end="01:24.800"><span begin="01:21.950" end="01